  (text "09 1090 MHz chain (BLB01 x2, TA2003A x2, ADL5513, MCP6566) and RP2040 capture" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7d68cf47-5a59-5e61-8ddf-c6096d4913d1"))
  (text "Chain per docs/ADSB_VALIDATION.md. BLB01 bias per BeRex rev 6.6 evaluation BOM (C1 100pF in, C2 12pF out, R1 6.8k/C3 12pF/L1 27nH Ven, R2 0R/C4 100pF/L2 82nH Vd)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 13.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06445ed3-9b38-53e5-b9f5-b7f4602d267c"))
  (text "ADL5513 measurement mode (VSET=VOUT), 52.3R input termination, 47nF coupling. TADJ resistor and CLPF (1 nF basic value is too slow for 0.5 us pulses) are TBD/bench items." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6880792e-802a-5b4f-8b26-091f183a4205"))
  (text "MCP6566T-E/OT base pin map, 2.2k pull-up to the RP2040 bank; threshold divider R86/R87 BLOCKED by OWN-09 (value TBD). R88/C88 DNP option: RP2040 PWM threshold." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9cf4f179-966e-500e-9dea-50cbe8bb55b6"))
  (text "RP2040 per DIG-01 (Raspberry Pi minimal design): 12 MHz ABM8-272-T3 + 1k XOUT, 15pF loads; QSPI_SS 1k to USB_BOOT pad; RUN 10k/100nF + TCA9535 P14. Domain 3V3_ADSB switched (P13)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bf6a20b8-9306-5236-9692-c1ffc6cd640e"))
  (text "UART0: GPIO0 TX -> RP_UART_RX, GPIO1 RX <- RP_UART_TX, GPIO2 CTS <- RP_UART_RTS, GPIO3 RTS -> RP_UART_CTS (one-shot pin choice). Back-power of ESP32-driven lines into an OFF RP2040 is an open SYS-02 item." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff01cb6e-70ea-5283-b66d-f72d28616409"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
